  "detail_text": "The Government intends to make a sole-source award to McKenna Engineering & Equipment Co, Inc. (McKenna) for a 3196 STI SIZE: 1X1.5-8/5V pump. Goulds’s 3196 STI SIZE: 1X1.5-8/5V pumps are installed and utilized for the sewage discharge system in the Military Sealift Command’s T-AO Class of ships. McKenna is the OEM-authorized parts provider for Goulds pumps in the state of California. This notice of intent is not a request for quotes . A determination not to compete the proposed procurement based upon responses to this notice is solely within the discretion of the Government.",
